# OpenClaw — Database Schema

## Stack

- **ORM**: Drizzle ORM
- **DB**: PostgreSQL (Render free tier)
- **Connection**: `pool` from `@workspace/db`
- **Migrations**: `pnpm --filter @workspace/db run push` (dev only)
- **Config**: `lib/db/drizzle.config.ts`

## All 28 Tables

