| Table | Key Columns | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `tenants` | `id` (text PK), `user_id`, `name`, `plan`, `status`, `render_service_id`, `ws_endpoint`, `gateway_token` | One per user. Auto-provisioned on first workspace create. |
| `activity_entries` | `id`, `tenant_id`, `type`, `message`, `created_at` | Audit log per agent |
| `chat_messages` | `id`, `tenant_id`, `role` (user/assistant/error), `content`, `created_at` | Per-tenant chat history |

